cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this record and the scientific sources relevant to your application."
title: "Atmospheric O2 triple-isotope model"
abstract: >-
  A transparent, reproducible atmospheric O2 triple-oxygen-isotope model that
  couples altitude-resolved photochemistry to a conservative global O2 and
  biological-turnover budget. The software supports forward calculations,
  constrained one-coordinate inversions, solution surfaces, transient
  experiments, and separated uncertainty layers.
type: software
